{"seq":2,"slug":"quality-gates","title":"质量门","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-cicd/quality-gates","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-code-review-in-ci","title":"CI 中的 AI 代码审查","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-cicd/quality-gates/ai-code-review-in-ci","wordCount":1195,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"auto-triage-failure","title":"失败自动分诊与修复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-cicd/quality-gates/auto-triage-failure","wordCount":905,"readingTime":4},{"seq":3,"slug":"test-generation-maintenance","title":"测试生成与维护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-cicd/quality-gates/test-generation-maintenance","wordCount":869,"readingTime":4}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"质量门\">质量门</h1><p>本章聚焦三条在 CI 流水线中落地最广的 AI 质量门：代码审查、失败自动分诊与修复、以及测试生成与维护。</p>\n<p>每条质量门都不是独立存在的。代码审查的结论可以触发测试生成；失败分诊的输出可以喂给代码审查做上下文补充。三篇文档既可独立阅读，也构成一套递进的质量保障体系。</p>\n"}